Rfa2K-dKWE4XbbkxYDh8X4q1Tk7N5G0zkzxuFiCvOQ=", "uri": "https://mediagateway.sweet.io/media/token/GqEKoQbD/12427120221775462400/poster-image-square.png"}], "reverse_image": null}, "attributes": [{"name": "Audio Type", "value": "Sounds of the Game"}, {"name": "Crafted from Editions", "value": "85,72,5"}, {"name": "Crafted from Rarity", "value": "Epic"}, {"name": "Date", "value": "2024-04-17"}, {"name": "Edition Number", "value": "1"}, {"name": "Moment UUID", "value": "b5c8ae7765540000ac76000000000000"}, {"name": "Play", "value": "Assist"}, {"name": "Player", "value": "Nikita Kucherov"}, {"name": "Rarity", "value": "Heroic"}, {"name": "Series", "value": "Series 1"}, {"name": "Series UUID", "value": "b5c8ae77000000000000000000000000"}, {"name": "Set", "value": "Signature Epics"}, {"name": "Set UUID", "value": "b5c8ae77655400000000000000000000"}, {"name": "Team", "value": "Tampa Bay Lightning"}], "creator": {"name": "SocialSweet Inc.", "uri": "https://sweet.io"}, "description": "In the final game of the 2023-24 season for the Tampa Bay Lightning, Nikita Kucherov entered the game just one assist shy of reaching 100 for the season.  Late in the second period while on a power play, he reached that mark.  Positioned at his customary spot on the half-wall, Kucherov received a pass from the point and swiftly delivered a one-time feed to Brayden Point, stationed in the bumper position, who promptly converted the opportunity. This assist not only marked Kucherov's 100th of the season but also solidified his place as just the fifth player in hockey history to accomplish such a feat. In a display of camaraderie, Kucherov's teammates rushed to congratulate him on this remarkable achievement. With an illustrious career already adorned with two Stanley Cup championships, a Hart Trophy, and two Art Ross trophies, Kucherov continues to embellish his hockey legacy.\r\n\r\nOfficially Licensed Product of the NHL, NHLPA, and/or NHLAA. All copyright, logos, and marks are the property of thei